e.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four classes to choose from when picking your monster squad: <strong>Slasher, Curser, Invoker, Alchemist</strong>. Picking the right monsters can enable many possible archetypes such as: <strong>Combo, Speed, Freeze, Ramp, Mismatch, Trap etc</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect monsters in a number of ways, through alchemy, digging them up in the Necropolis or as a gift from the Collector. Unlock many customizable options for each monster and alter their appearance: <strong>VFX, SFX, jump scare variations etc</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/25782611d9107155d5fe2cc24fabfecf.webp?t=1757195203\" width=616 height=27 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/6a61c469c2acbe8be4917cdd038969c9.poster.avif?t=1757195203\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/6a61c469c2acbe8be4917cdd038969c9.webm?t=1757195203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/6a61c469c2acbe8be4917cdd038969c9.mp4?t=1757195203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find and collect many variations of tombstones, statues, terrains, walls and ambient effects for your graveyard. Design and show off your unique and personal graveyard setup in battles ahead and impress your enemies while you bring their fears upon them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/